{
 "id": "250-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Embracing diversity and encouraging open dialogue are essential to our growth as a team and as individuals.",
  "So, for function argument names, we always start them with 'i_' as a prefix.",
  "This helps us easily identify and distinguish them from other variables or parameters.",
  "As for method names, we use the prefix 'a_'.",
  "Please make sure to follow this convention going forward.",
  "I'll be sure to let you know if there are any other specific guidelines we need to follow, but for now, just focus on those naming conventions and we can go from there.",
  "It's key to driving results and achieving our goals.",
  "Accountability and ownership go hand-in-hand with effective collaboration.",
  "When we trust that our colleagues are owning their responsibilities, we can focus on our own tasks while knowing that the overall project is in capable hands.",
  "We encourage engineers to speak up if they encounter roadblocks or need clarification.",
  "Having a fresh pair of eyes review your work is invaluable.",
  "It not only helps catch potential errors but also fosters a sense of mutual support and learning.",
  "Remember, ownership and accountability are about taking pride in your work and striving for excellence.",
  "It's important to stay open-minded and be willing to try new things.",
  "And it's great that you're involving users in the process, as their feedback is invaluable.",
  "By prioritizing integrity, you're not only ensuring the quality of your work but also building trust with your colleagues and clients.",
  "Remember, these values are the foundation of our work here at AXIOM, and I'm confident that you're on the right track to becoming an invaluable asset to the company."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 179,
 "update_calls": 207,
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "4:37",
   "text": "Embracing diversity and encouraging open dialogue are essential to our growth as a team and as individuals.",
   "key": "new:4:37",
